debark: lock: read emptydir\lock.json: GetFileAttributesEx emptydir\lock.json: The system cannot find the file specified.

Usage:
  debark store gc [BUNDLE...] [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run        report what would be removed without removing anything
  -h, --help           help for gc
      --store string   store location (default: config store_dir, else the XDG-correct default)

Global Flags:
      --config string        config file path (overrides XDG discovery)
      --json                 print the documented JSON object for this command instead of human text
      --json-events string   stream NDJSON evidence events to PATH, or "-" for stdout
      --no-color             disable coloured output (also honours NO_COLOR and TERM=dumb)
      --profile string       named config profile to apply
